				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Didici in hoc <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>itinere<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. oben <ref target="file10553">Nr. 517</ref>, Anm. 6.</note> te turbari, quod falsum de te <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>suspicatus sum<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> hatte <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vorgeworfen, er verweigere ihm eine Zusammenkunft; vgl. <bibl source="b6">HBBW IV</bibl>, <ref target="file10530">Nr. 494</ref>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Oro, istuc mihi condones; <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nam video et agnosco me falsum esse.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Sed caussa ea fuit, quod tu veram caussam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>in tuis literis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist wohl das nicht erhaltene Begleitschreiben zum Zürcher Abendmahlsbekenntnis vom Dezember 1534 (vgl. <bibl source="b6">HBBW IV</bibl> <ref target="file10532">[Nr. 496]</ref>, S. 454, Anm. 2). Unterdessen hatte <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> sein Fernbleiben vom <placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> Treffen näher begründet und <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> eine Zusammenkunft unter Beteiligung der <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> und <placeName ref="l28">Basler</placeName> angeboten; vgl. oben <ref target="file10564">Nr. 528</ref>, 31-46.</note> non expresseras adiecerasque non <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>videri tibi, ad quid opus esset tua praesentia, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cum scripto vestram confessionem<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><bibl source="b6">HBBW IV</bibl>, <ref target="file10518">Nr. 482</ref>.</note> abunde <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>expresseritis nec possitis ultra quicquam dare, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ut qui nesciatis cauponari verbum dei<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. ebd., S. 428, 219. <persName ref="p18722">Erasmus</persName> gebraucht diese Wendung bei der Übersetzung von <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 2, 17</ref></cit> (s. <bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> VI 758, Anm. 20).</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Hinc quid aliud potui animadvertere, quam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vos nolle colloqui et de nobis iudicare, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ut qui velint verbum domini cauponari?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nam petebamus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ultra scriptum illud<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">scriptum illud <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> colloquium vestrum et in eo, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ut plura daretis, quam dedistis, maxime <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quantum ad verba attinet.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Videor enim videre <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>vos rem ipsam agnoscere.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Si vel verbo s<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ignificasses non esse integrum vobis sine <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernatibus</placeName> et <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensibus</placeName> venire, cum eam ipsam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>caussam suspicatus essem obstituram, ego profecto <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nihil motus fuissem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Obsecro nunc, ut dominum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>oretis, uti is nos plene iungat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>scribam plura<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> schrieb erst wieder an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, nachdem er von <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> nach <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> zurückgekehrt war (s. unten <ref target="file10661">Nr. 623</ref>).</note>, et de nostro alicubi conventu.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Nam vel nihil video vel valde necessarium <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>est nos sępius convenire atque de religionis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nostrae locis nos solidius tractare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><pb type="edition" next="110"/>Optime <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>vale et commenda me pientissimis viris, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="||425v."/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><placeName ref="l512">Tubingae</placeName>, 15. februarii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p467">M. Bucęrus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Optimo et ver<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>e in domino docto <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>viro <persName ref="p495">Heylrycho Bullin<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>gero</persName>, fratri chari<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ssimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
